// tracked constrained contents to []. Inside a span, if the current constrained
// prefix is complete we close it with CloseConstrainedSpan; otherwise we take a
// parser-valid constrained step and append that token. EOS remains terminal.
// This design is intentionally simple and delimiter-forward so that generated
// text contains arithmetic spans much more reliably.
