//   that helper call, and AppendConstrainedToken does not change helpers.cost,
//   so helpers.cost <= steps is preserved.
// progress: The stay-outside branch appends one token to generated after one
//   step. OpenConstrainedSpan appends the opening delimiter token after one
//   step. CloseConstrainedSpan appends the closing delimiter token after one
